{"id":"00275","root":"uni00275_1","name":{"ja":"高坂　静流","en":"Kousaka Shizuru"},"title":{"ja":"【聖夜の花】","en":"【Holy Eve Flowers】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【聖夜の花】 高坂　静流","en":"【Holy Eve Flowers】 Kousaka Shizuru"},"aliases":["Kosaka Shizuru"],"element":"Natural","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-12-16","limited":true,"characterId":26,"profile":{"ja":"単独での危険な潜入任務を得意とする手練の対魔忍。才色兼備の女性で６ヶ国語に通じ、２つの博士号と数十に渡る分野の専門知識を有し、あらゆる経歴の人物となって潜入可能という高度な隠密技術の持ち主。忍法・木遁の術の使い手であり戦闘能力も高い。通称“花の静流”。植物を操り、特定の武器は持たず戦闘時は掌から強力な薔薇の鞭を出現させ操って戦う。物腰軽やかな大人の女性で、男性を魅了するその妖艶な魅力も潜入任務には欠かせない才能の一つ。今回の潜入先は、企業の合同クリスマスパーティ。しかしパーティというのは表向きで、実は魔族組織との密会の隠れ蓑だというたれ込みがあった。それを確かめる為、静流はコンパニオンとして潜入したのだった。","en":"Kousaka Shizuru is a seasoned Taimanin who excels at dangerous solo infiltration missions. She is a strikingly beautiful and highly intelligent woman fluent in six languages, holding two doctorates and expertise across dozens of fields, allowing her to assume any identity for covert operations. A master of the ninja art of Wood Release, she also boasts formidable combat abilities. Known as \"Flower Shizuru,\" she manipulates plants and, instead of wielding conventional weapons, summons a powerful rose-whip from her palm to fight. With a light, graceful demeanor, she exudes a seductive charm that captivates men—a talent essential for her infiltration work. Her current target is a corporate joint Christmas party, which, on the surface, serves as a festive gathering but is rumored to be a cover for a secret meeting with a demon organization. To verify this, Shizuru has infiltrated the event as a companion."},"illustrator":"葵渚","voiceActor":"花南","forms":[{"id":"uni00275_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1168,2336],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[104,208],"def":[128,256],"spd":[56,56],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["4","420001"],"evolve":[["evo00010",5],["evo00011",15],["evo00012",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00275_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","l